# hologram.fmat — three effects that only read as one thing together.
#
# Self-lit so it is not shaded by the room it is standing in, scrolling so it
# reads as a signal rather than a decal, and part-transparent so what is behind
# it shows through. Each was reachable before; having them under one name is
# what makes it a hologram rather than three settings that have to be repeated
# on every panel.
kind: surface
doc: A projected display — self-lit, drifting, see-through.
effects:
  - effect: unlit
  - effect: uv_scroll
    rate: [0, 0.18]
  - effect: alpha
    value: 0.55
